  "description": "A recording frame is a data frame or the end marker, never both. A data frame: a usec below one second, a direction, at least one byte, a sec a u32 holds (until 2106). The end marker: no data, and an end state — killed or terminated, never a reason, which is the audit's. Every frame of every collected recording is held to these rules.",
